+#ORTG-TSV: 2
+#====项目纲要====
+#【部署】Python MLflow library; public task validation is via pytest against repository code, with no deployment mutation in this outline phase.
+#【系统】MLflow evaluation subsystem | Python dataclasses, dynamic callables, prompt templates, pandas row data, threaded judge scoring | Preserve documented public signatures, prompt/output formatting, row alignment, validation, persistence metadata, and deprecation surfaces.
+#【整体规范】Task-mode partial outline: only files selected in /agent-logs/related_files.json are maintained; unrelated bare entries remain unknown. Public-task requirements and current masked source state are recorded separately, and absence of visible coverage remains explicit.
+#【契约】judge-result：GenAI judge responses cross raw provider output, parser, per-row scoring, MetricValue, and evaluator consumption; the public task requires JSON-first parsing, labeled-text fallback only after JSON decoding failure, integer score conversion, justification semantics, and stable row alignment.；【裁决】需求直接规定解析优先级、整数转换和稳定行序；本次名称与变量校验不改变响应解析、并发写回或 MetricValue 输出，保持现有守护契约。
+#【契约】prompt-context：PromptTemplate, EvaluationExample, v1 EvaluationModel, and metric factories share block omission and grading-context text formatting; non-None required values include a whole block, missing/None required values omit it, and include_input controls input blocks.；【裁决】需求直接要求 PromptTemplate 对 None/缺失块省略，同时提示工厂明确要求对应变量必须提供；模板层继续保持省略语义，工厂层单独校验用户提示变量，两者可同时满足且无需改其他参与者。
+#【契约】metric-callable：EvaluationMetric construction, make_metric exports, dynamic callable generation, and evaluator consumption share eval_fn-derived keyword-only signatures; strict GenAI calls validate/conform row inputs while non-strict calls forward declared arguments, and outputs are MetricValue-compatible.；【裁决】需求直接要求工厂生成的调用对象按 eval_fn 派生关键字签名，并说明缺失变量属于异常；本次仅在提示工厂内部校验其已声明变量，不改变动态类、导出或消费者签名，保持现有守护测试。
+#【契约】metric-persistence：GenAI factories retain reconstructable factory arguments which the evaluator logs and retrieve_custom_metrics deserializes; factory identity, version, examples, prompt arguments, model parameters, headers, proxy, worker count, and metadata must survive this path as applicable.；【裁决】需求直接要求保留可重建工厂参数；本次校验不改变持久化字段或反序列化调用，现有工厂参数继续完整保留，保持守护测试。
